# MLB Parlay Agent

> AI-powered MLB parlay recommendation system using ML-based leg scoring with temporary bias adjustments, stat-specific calibrated predictions, pitcher-aware matchup logic, and quality-first selection

[![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-fixes%20deployed%20awaiting%20validation-yellow)](https://railway.app)
[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10-blue)](https://python.org)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-personal%20research-lightgrey)](LICENSE)

---

## 🎯 Overview

The MLB Parlay Agent is a production system that generates daily MLB parlay recommendations by:
- Scoring 200-400 player props daily using a **calibrated ML model** with **temporary bias adjustments** (Brier: 0.2341, +16.6% improvement)
- Applying **three scoring adjustments** to correct direction bias, odds signal, and same-game correlation (expected +60% hit rate improvement)
- Using **pure quality-first selection** (diversity constraint removed May 11)
- Applying pitcher-aware matchup analysis and handedness-split coverage rates
- Filtering by **game start time** (fail-closed: only games starting >15 min from now)
- Building optimized 4-6 leg parlays targeting +1000 to +1500 odds
- Tracking outcomes and learning from 90,000+ historical resolved legs

**Last Major Update:** May 11, 2026 — Comprehensive diagnostic analysis, scoring adjustments deployed, diversity constraint removed, game_start_time reliability improved

