## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Language:** Python 3.10
- **ML:** Scikit-learn (LogisticRegression + IsotonicRegression)
- **Database:** Supabase PostgreSQL
- **Hosting:** Railway (PaaS, auto-deploy from master)
- **Data Sources:** 
  - TheOddsAPI (MLB props)
  - MLB-StatsAPI (game logs, schedules, box scores)
- **Web:** Flask + vanilla HTML/CSS/JS

